{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2023-02-01 10:43:00', 'title': 'MAGNA HOSTS 3RD ANNUAL EQUITY UPFRONT™ FOCUSED ON MAXIMIZING FOR OPTIMAL OUTCOMES', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MAGNA, THE INVESTMENT AND INTELLIGENCE COMPANY OF IPG MEDIABRANDS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS THIRD ANNUAL EQUITY UPFRONT™ WILL BE TAKING PLACE FEBRUARY 7 –9, 2023. THE THEME OF THIS YEAR'S EVENT IS MAXIMIZING FOR OPTIMAL OUTCOMES, WITH A DEEPENED FOCUS ON SPOTLIGHTING OPPORTUNITIES FOR CLIENTS AND AGENCIES THAT SUPPORT DIVERSELY-OWNED AND TARGETED MEDIA PARTNERS."}